	(text "Worst case: both posts 97.1 W = 4.05 A of the converter's 6.5 A (62%); HV side 0.71 A at the 160 V floor." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "207da7c0-75d9-5faa-916d-6b1d8bbdf01d"))
	(text "F_HV is 2 A and DC-rated to 1000 V. An ATO blade fuse is rated 32 V — legal on the 24 V side (F_P1/F_P2), an arc hazard here." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "364b5adc-3eb9-54d9-8d98-9ae6f2f00e30"))
